<title>HONG KONG: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Sino Land.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Sino Land.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co C.V. said on Tuesday it has launched 500 million American style call warrants on shares of Sino Land Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$9.05	PREMIUM	21.2 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.198     GEARING	4.6x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  13.FEB.98    EXER LOT     20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    PAYDATE	04.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$9.10	LISTING DATE 05.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOVERNING LAW     HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL SETTLEMENT ONLY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
